    "notes": [
      "DEATH DATE MINOR DISCREPANCY (research 2026-07-03): Geni's \"Josiah Alberson (Albertson) Jr.\" gives a will dated Dec 1782 and an estate inventory dated 7 Jan 1783, implying death in late 1782 or very early January 1783 — running somewhat earlier than the export's \"7 Mar 1783.\" Not a fundamental identity problem (the tree's own extensive source list — Quaker meeting records, NJ wills, Find A Grave — indicates real archival work on this branch), but the exact date is unconfirmed; possibly a \"Jan\"/\"Mar\" transcription slip. See father William Albertson's record (I182197776810) and grandfather Josiah Albertson Sr.'s record (I182197770339) for the wider family's extensively corrected data."
    ]
